# License

## SPDB original material (CC BY 4.0)

Unless otherwise noted, original SPDB material in this repository is released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This includes annotation guidelines, codebooks, schemas, label inventories, Wave-1
diagnostic annotations produced for SPDB, disagreement analyses, and original
documentation authored by the SPDB team.

You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if
changes were made.

## Software / scripts

Repository analysis and pipeline scripts are released under the same CC BY 4.0 terms
for this archive, unless an individual file states otherwise.

## Upstream / derived third-party material

### ParlaMint-derived text

Parliamentary unit texts redistributed in SPDB samples and Wave-1 packages are
derived from **ParlaMint 5.0** (ParlaMint-ES), distributed by CLARIN.SI under
**CC BY 4.0**:

- Handle: https://www.clarin.si/repository/xmlui/handle/11356/2004
- Project: https://www.clarin.eu/parlamint

Users must retain ParlaMint attribution when reusing those texts.

### FallacyES-Political and other external corpora

External fallacy corpora used for ontology-compatibility experiments are **not**
redistributed in this release. Acquisition instructions and mapping code are
provided under `scripts/external_validation/` and related documentation. Upstream
licence terms apply to any local copy obtained by the user.

### Manifestos / social media

This release does **not** redistribute manifesto full texts or social-media post
bodies.

