| ParlaMint-derived unit text in shipped samples | Yes (attribution required) | Upstream CC BY 4.0 |
| FallacyES-Political raw/mapped corpora | No (reproduce locally) | Upstream terms |
| Manifesto / social-media full text | No | N/A |
